          <!-- BODY -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:28px 32px;
                       font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#212121;">

              <p>Hello fellow hams,</p>

              <p>
                One week to go! The
                <strong>August Hunt</strong> at
                <strong>Marymoor Park</strong> is on
                <strong>Saturday, August 22</strong>, starting
                at noon.
              </p>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                Quick Details
              </h3>
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                     border="0"
                     style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="140"
                      style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Date &amp; Time:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>Saturday, August 22, 2026</strong>,
                    Noon &ndash; 2:30&nbsp;PM
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Location:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>Marymoor Park</strong><br>
                    6046 W Lake Sammamish Pkwy NE,
                    Redmond, WA&nbsp;98052
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Frequency:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>147.42&nbsp;MHz simplex</strong>
                    (callsign K7LED); net control on K7LED repeater
                    (alt 146.580&nbsp;MHz FM simplex)
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Parking:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    Free lots at park entrance. Arrive before
                    noon; it fills quickly on concert days.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Transit:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    Sound Transit 2 Line &mdash; Marymoor
                    Village Station
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="background-color:#fff8e1;border-left:4px solid
                        #f0a500;padding:12px 16px;margin:20px 0;
                        font-size:14px;">
                <strong>Reminder:</strong> Hard stop at
                <strong>2:30&nbsp;PM</strong>. The park becomes
                very crowded before the evening Marymoor Live
                concert.
              </p>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                What to Bring
              </h3>
              <ul style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  HT programmed to 147.42&nbsp;MHz &mdash; or
                  borrow one at the event
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Tape-measure Yagi antenna &mdash; or borrow
                  one at the event
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Step attenuator (for close-in work)
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Comfortable walking shoes, water, and a snack
                </li>
              </ul>

              <p>
                Need to borrow gear? Contact
                <strong>Tom Sayles, KE4HET</strong> at
                [TOM-EMAIL] by Friday so we can plan.
              </p>
              <p>
                Participation is open (no registration required). Check
                in with net control at hunt start or when you begin
                hunting. RSVP to FoxHunting@mkarc.groups.io is
                requested, not required.
              </p>

              <p>
                See you at Marymoor! 73 de KE4HET
              </p>

